      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>7CM BGL IN MANHOLE 33CM SE M/P

BCP610. Seven Persons Creek Coulee
Elevation 702.309 m
7CM. BGL.,MANHOLE &amp; COVER. ON TOP OF BANK OF SEVEN PERSONS CREEK 250 M NE OF TEEPEE; FOLLOW TRAIL FROM TEEPEE TO EDGE OF COULEE AND GO EAST; 17M S OF EDGE OF COULEE ;72M E OF C/L OF ASPHALT TRAIL 33CM SE OF SURVEY MARKER POST
</groundspeak:encoded_hints>
