          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP610 - Seven Persons Creek Coulee

N 50° 01.049 W 110° 41.534&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For the last couple of years I would see the marker post for this cap from the TransCanada and it would drive me crazy. Finally I had a spare 20 minutes and told everyone that I would be right back. 15 minutes later I was taking pics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whew, finally!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
