          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP610 Seven Persons Creek Coulee (the teepee cap), 700m

I parked at the teepee and made the short walk over to this well-marked cap. I imagine its always windy on this hill - at least it has been whenever we've been here.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
